{"body":{"text":["*Awaiting the author's ratification. Knowledge is to be rewritten whole once the elevation is done (23/152); until then the rest of it still speaks of what goes as current, and Keeping the field and its Elevation are written as the work is now to be done, to be marked ratified once he has read and accepted them (23/152).*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Reading every session to be aligned is \"probably going to be a debt soon\", since \"We haven't purified the knowledge\" (15/1, 15/3). Knowledge is that purifying, regenerated whole when the sessions have moved past it, as it is to be once the elevation is done (23/152)."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The field is written today by the author's tools in `author/`, through the engine: `session.ts` keeps a session, `append.ts` adds an utterance, and `rewrite.ts` writes briefs. `thread.ts`, and what the other tools still do for threads, paths, cycles and measures, are no part of the work. The tools are to go (settled 2026-11-11), the author's direction being away from rigid scripts toward clear types and structure and practices held as skills, so an agent knows how to work and does the work with the engine directly (15/31); the command line able to commit was to replace them. Whether they go now or wait for commits written in the field he left open: \"I don't know if we should remove them yet, or if we're waiting for the better commit expressions to come in place\" (23/146); for now they stay, with this note (23/148). *Open.*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A question is held in the field as a statement whose status is open, once the statement type is written: \"if something is a question, make it. In the substrate.\" (10/8, 23/79). Until then it is said in the session and carried in Knowledge's prose."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2003","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The elevation as drawn here is the author's leaning, 23/50 to 23/138, at his \"everything looks fine\" (23/132); what the session added is marked as the session's where it stands.*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2004","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Closed points at what closed it, a statement, a commit, a brief or the author's word, at his thought that \"you just point to whatever caused it to be superseded\" (23/134, 23/135), and may be opened again: \"Knowledge is built on its grounds, and any new ground may always exist, shifting the landscape of other pieces of knowledge\" (23/138). The reader holding all the sessions offered set aside or closed (23/137), and the author leaned to closed: \"Closed is probably better. It's more precise, but it's still ambiguous as to its reason\", where set aside \"tells more about the reason and might be wrong in that\" (23/138)."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2005","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **topic** is a type of its own, a short name holding statements (23/105, 23/115, 23/131): \"topics need short names because topics naturally are addressable\" (23/116). A statement may stand in several topics, the session's answer (23/111). Topics may hold topics, \"you can structure a group and there's a hierarchy in and of itself\" (23/86), though whether the reader's six groups are such he did not know (23/110); of topics and statements composing he said, \"Yeah, why not?\" (23/112)."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2006","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Threads, paths and cycles go once the sessions are drawn anew: \"Yes, threads and paths are let go, but so is more things, cycles, etc.\" (23/110). Condensations and measures go with them on the session's list, which he did not contest (23/111, 23/112), though he had wondered whether measures are a dimension of their own (23/52). Until the redraw, what goes stays in the field as it is, and is no part of the work."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2007","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Glass's values are to be a brief of their own, \"somewhere anyway, probably\", and \"it's not about taking every quote and elevating them\" (23/62)."]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2008","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Knowledge is to hold this practice whole, as a skill, so the next session can do it from Knowledge alone: \"the knowledge holon should contain naturally everything because it's a skill\" (23/130, 23/131). Its steps: the types, statement and topic, written with their moulds; the twelfth, eighteenth and twenty-third sessions drawn and read back by a blank reader; then every session drawn and the work gathered in briefs; then threads, paths, cycles, condensations and measures let go, and Knowledge rewritten whole (23/129, 23/131, 23/152). *The order the session's (23/129, 23/131), the author's go-ahead at 23/138.*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F2009","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*Stale: the words still speak of threads, paths, cycles, condensations and measures as current, and are to be rewritten whole once the elevation is done (23/152).*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F200A","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*Knowledge is to be rewritten whole once the elevation is done (23/152); until then, all but Keeping the field still speaks of threads, paths, cycles, condensations and measures as current.*"]},"id":"1M89M52R00F200B","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}